1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,672
Little Hanuman saw a golden fruit hanging in the sky.

2
00:00:04,022 --> 00:00:07,382
He leapt for it—laughing, climbing the wind.

3
00:00:08,282 --> 00:00:10,994
Indra's thunder struck him from the heavens.

4
00:00:11,994 --> 00:00:14,778
The gods gathered around the fallen child.

5
00:00:15,178 --> 00:00:18,154
They hid his strength behind a soft forgetting.

6
00:00:19,254 --> 00:00:23,982
Years later, one true name unlocked what sleep had sealed.

7
00:00:24,982 --> 00:00:27,478
What felt like weakness was only a lock.

8
00:00:28,378 --> 00:00:30,922
And locks exist for the hour you are ready.

